    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Grey alchemical powder that smells of snow. As a Bonus Action, fling a pinch at a point within 60 feet: every nonmagical flame in a 20-foot-radius Sphere there goes out in a cold rush of air.</p><section class=\"secret ravenmoor-dm-note\" id=\"secret-snuffing-powder\"><p><strong>DM:</strong> Loot. In the fight Quill uses his own Snuffing Powder bonus action (2/Day) from his actor sheet; this pouch is what the party finds in his bag afterwards, so set its remaining uses to whatever he has left. The 8:55 pinch in the Great Hall is story, not a spent use.</p></section>",
